    <item>
      <title>TOTK MUSIC MASH-UP (READ DESCRIPTION)</title>
      <author>Porroman420</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/657341</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/657341#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a84749bf7a716b3c9f5e3e67014b08598c52c896</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 22:37:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69a6906292bd8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69a69069b6ca9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69a690774fb56.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abd9f4b5ec0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abda95c750c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abdaaf8deaf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abdab4abcb3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abdae66db70.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abdaeada6cd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69abf9d58ad43.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Lower volumes for couple songs&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;I lowered the volume for the fairy fountain\lightroot theme, indeed was a bit too loud, i lowered the volume for these and the jingle that plays when you solve riddles or open monster camp chest, it was also a bit too loud, now both are more pleasant with headphones.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the eviroment tkcl is still version 2.0.0, the fix is self contained inside the new activator &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;please follow tkmm install instructions - both tkcl are needed, the activator must be above all involved mods :D &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;have fun,  once rain let's me i will update the enviromental version number.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;for those who already have it just update your activator, select your options and merge your modlist again&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: A couple tracks made less loud&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#6ee16c" class="SelectedElement"&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;u&gt;YOU NEED BOTH TKCL FILES TO MAKE MOD WORK&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, TKMM COMPATIBLE ONLY FOR EASY INSTALL ALONG WEAPON SOUND EFFECTS, VOICE ACTORS AND SUCH&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hello, this time i wanna share with you folks a personal mod that it's a modified version of &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/617939"&gt;Tears of Time&lt;/a&gt; and  &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/576166"&gt;TOTK Old music&lt;/a&gt; playlist put together by hand (the same songs but from my own bwav conversions, also some small changes)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Music mods can't be merged together, specially if they modify BGM_Static.bars.zs file, this personal mod has the intention to make the originals (with some meddling from your part) or this modified iteration from both mods above work together and be compatible with Depths of the kingdom Sound options :D&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=yeah+boy+meme&amp;oq=yeah+boy+meme&amp;gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUqBwgAEAAYgAQyBwgAEAAYgAQyBwgBEC4YgAQyBwgCEAAYgAQyBwgDEAAYgAQyBwgEEAAYgAQyBwgFEAAYgAQyBwgGEAAYgAQyBwgHEAAYgAQyBwgIEAAYgATSAQgxOTk5ajBqN6gCALACAA&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8" target="_blank"&gt;What i did\added\removed:&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Thanks to @PotatoFried17 now the "Depths exploration music only" and the "Standalone" activators + patches now enable Title music for the game as Depths of the Kingdom Music Overhaul (A different song so you know what music option you have activated using the compatibility patch :D)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Removed the BOTW battle themes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Made TOTK old music Hinox theme the main Hinox theme&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Changed the piano "i wanna be jazz" vanilla jingle when you solve riddles and puzzles with the one from OoT.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Made the Fairy fountain theme loop (i found weird for it to end and start again in the middle of the "fairy getting out her bud" whole interaction)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Also made the fairy fountain theme the one you will hear when below a lightroot (because they heal your gloomed hearts lol)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Added the Dark Souls sound effect option&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Now you can make it compatible with Depths of the kingdom by turning on or off the matching DOTK option inside the activator :D &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;(if people have interest in making this mod compatible with another mod that modifies static.bars comment it below, if a new mod is added, the main focus will be to preserve the originals, this mod and DOTK's music, so maybe not all songs from that new mod will make it, just the ones that complement the original music mods, DOTK music overhaul or this modified iteration)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;All credits go to the original mod creators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#6ee16c"&gt;----- HOW TO SET UP TKMM :D (Depths of the kingdom compatibility) -----&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-TOTK MUSIC MASH-UP ACTIVATOR + PATCH (Match Depths of the kingdom option)&lt;br&gt;-Depths of the kingdom (Select your Sound option)&lt;br&gt;-TOTK MUSIC MASH UP (enviroment) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;OR IF YOU ALREADY HAVE OR WANNA USE  THE ORIGINAL&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/download/617939#FileInfo_1594830"&gt; Tears of Time&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/576166"&gt;TOTK old music&lt;/a&gt; MODS :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;-TOTK MUSIC MASH-UP ACTIVATOR + PATCH (Match Depths of the kingdom option)&lt;br&gt;-Depths of the kingdom (Select your Sound option)&lt;br&gt;-&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/download/617939#FileInfo_1594830"&gt;Tears of Time&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt; (must be modified to prevent errors, download tearsofthetime_files_121.zip version and delete Bgm folder inside romfs\Sound.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/576166"&gt;-&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/576166"&gt;TOTK Old music (the original mod)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;(must be modified to prevent errors, download LATEST version and delete all BGM_FieldBattle.bwavs inside romfs\Sound\Resource\Stream.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;to activate or deactivate Depths of the kingdom Depths overhaul music select "Depths exploration only" both in DOTK and TOTK MUSIC MASH-UP ACTIVATOR + PATCH&lt;br&gt;--------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Ps: you can install as many music mods you want as long as they don't edit the BGM_static.bars, &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#6ee16c"&gt;if you encounter an issue or have trouble setting this up you can always DM me at discord &lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;porroman.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Have fun !</description>
