      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a976dd42986f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/649b18603a131.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/649b18600efb3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/649a70e7cd19f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64861a2e977ea.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64861a2e9b191.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64855c318424b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64855c31a26c9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64855c31b718e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/64855c319f763.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/649a70e7cad31.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; TKMM Compatibility&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Added TKCL for explicit TKMM compatibility&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod changes the texture of the Hylian Armor set (and its dyed variations) to replace the various leather pieces with chainmail, to better visually protect Link as he travels through Hyrule. Just because there aren't laser octopus robots running rampant doesn't mean our courageous protagonist can go running around torturing koroks without basic bodily protection.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note that the Hylian Hood does not have its dye variants modified, as they would all have the same texture if this was the case.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod works with all versions up to and including v1.2.1. Contained within the .zip is also a .rcl file, which you can use in NX Editor to generate a merged restbl with other mods.&lt;br&gt;</description>
